      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=160%><b>Welcome!</b></size>\nThis room lets you experience how some
    visual conditions affect everyday life. Look around, pick up objects and try
    reading, then switch conditions and see how it changes.\n\n<size=130%><b>Controls</b></size>\n\u2022
    <b>Open / close the condition menu:</b> Menu button on the left controller\n\u2022
    <b>Pick a condition:</b> point at the menu and press the trigger\n\u2022 <b>Grab
    objects:</b> hold the grip button\n\u2022 <b>Read the book:</b> pick it up and
    tap the page edges or the Next / Previous buttons\n\u2022 <b>Move:</b> left thumbstick\n\u2022
    <b>Turn:</b> right thumbstick"
